WEBVTT

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:12.638
Leon!

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:14.056
I've got it.

00:00:14.473 --> 00:00:16.725
What was missing was a person.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.644
<i>The final ignition factor...</i>

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:21.605
<i>was me!</i>

00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:24.983
<i>What are your intentions, Leon Lau?</i>

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.946
<i>You, who brought the world to ruin.</i>

00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:01.913
The Opener of the Box

00:02:01.997 --> 00:02:06.460
Multidimensional Attack!

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:13.592
Interference rate, 160%.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.594
Accumulation rate, 185%.

00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:18.055
Higher outputs than I had predicted!

00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:23.894
Engage armaments.

00:02:32.027 --> 00:02:33.403
Hit it!

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.328
What kind of fighting is that?

00:02:41.411 --> 00:02:43.538
Can he not control his strength?

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:50.754
Reactor accumulation values increasing.

00:02:50.962 --> 00:02:53.673
This ain't funny anymore.
Has he lost control?

00:02:53.757 --> 00:02:56.593
Calm down! The reactor can handle
this level of stress.

00:03:11.983 --> 00:03:15.362
Is it trying to disperse damage
across multiple subspaces?

00:03:52.816 --> 00:03:53.692
Leon!

00:03:57.195 --> 00:03:58.196
Chloe!

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:03.618
<i>Are you okay, little girl?</i>

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:08.665
-Hop in! Quick!
-Okay!

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:18.508
Take this!

00:04:22.888 --> 00:04:24.097
Its weak point...

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:25.766
is there!

00:04:26.349 --> 00:04:27.684
Quantum blade!

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:39.404
The defense system...

00:04:43.492 --> 00:04:46.453
-Find the soft parts at the joints...
<i>-Isn't that...?</i>

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:11.603
<i>The last refuge of humanity.</i>

00:05:12.103 --> 00:05:13.480
The last hope.

00:05:13.897 --> 00:05:14.940
Neo Xianglong.

00:05:22.572 --> 00:05:25.116
As eye-catching a town as ever.

00:05:45.595 --> 00:05:49.266
This will change the world
and cause everything to evolve.

00:05:49.641 --> 00:05:51.476
It's a vessel of possibility...

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.520
<i>the quantum reactor.</i>

00:05:56.773 --> 00:05:57.649
Leon?

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.194
Chloe...

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:04.364
You're okay?!

00:06:04.739 --> 00:06:05.574
Are you hurt?

00:06:06.074 --> 00:06:07.659
I'm fine.

00:06:08.535 --> 00:06:09.619
What a relief.

00:06:12.497 --> 00:06:13.331
Where are we?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.793
Neo Xianglong.
The soldiers brought us here.

00:06:17.544 --> 00:06:18.587
Neo Xianglong...

00:06:19.796 --> 00:06:21.298
<i>What happened to the BRAI?</i>

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.633
<i>Huh? You defeated it.</i>

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:24.884
<i>I did?</i>

00:06:25.552 --> 00:06:26.720
You don't remember?

00:06:28.847 --> 00:06:30.015
What's going on?

00:06:30.098 --> 00:06:31.933
Perhaps my brain was protecting itself

00:06:32.017 --> 00:06:34.978
from the vast amount of information
it received when I synced

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:35.979
with the hyperdrive.

00:06:36.688 --> 00:06:37.522
Or perhaps...

00:06:38.648 --> 00:06:40.525
Family contract, Article 12!

00:06:40.692 --> 00:06:42.444
"Run away as soon as you see a BRAI."

00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:44.529
-I was so worried!
-Sorry! Ouch, my neck!

00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:48.867
If you do something like this again,
I'll annul our family contract!

00:06:50.619 --> 00:06:51.995
I'm giving this back.

00:06:53.038 --> 00:06:54.039
Yeah.

00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:56.207
I'm sorry.

00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:57.459
All is well.

00:06:57.667 --> 00:07:01.254
That was amazing, though.
Your hyper thing was a success?

00:07:01.338 --> 00:07:02.547
Hyperdrive.

00:07:02.839 --> 00:07:06.176
There were some anomalies,
so I wouldn't call it finished, but...

00:07:09.012 --> 00:07:09.846
Leon?

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.561
Leon? What's wrong?

00:07:18.772 --> 00:07:19.648
My heart...

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:21.024
No.

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:23.401
My gall bladder? Pancreas? Diaphragm?

00:07:23.568 --> 00:07:25.987
Or my solar plexus? No...

00:07:30.909 --> 00:07:32.577
<i>Somewhere, in this city...</i>

00:07:33.536 --> 00:07:34.537
<i>is that man.</i>

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.503
How terrifying.

00:07:43.046 --> 00:07:44.214
What are you doing?

00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:46.549
Queenie, right?

00:07:46.967 --> 00:07:50.470
I thought I’d give you some warmth,
out here alone in the cold.

00:07:52.305 --> 00:07:54.808
Or was your solitude
enough company for you?

00:07:55.225 --> 00:07:56.643
Have you seen my partner?

00:07:56.726 --> 00:07:57.560
No.

00:07:57.936 --> 00:08:00.188
Where's that Emilia run off to now?

00:08:00.438 --> 00:08:01.439
Who are you?

00:08:01.606 --> 00:08:03.608
I didn't notice your presence at all.

00:08:04.025 --> 00:08:06.236
Just a slave... to a cat.

00:08:06.611 --> 00:08:08.029
<i>There you are. Outsiders!</i>

00:08:10.782 --> 00:08:11.783
You're that...

00:08:13.535 --> 00:08:15.996
Captain of the Sixth Defense Team,

00:08:16.413 --> 00:08:17.706
Captain Gren Din.

00:08:18.081 --> 00:08:21.251
Captain? Neo Xianglong
must really be short on personnel.

00:08:21.418 --> 00:08:24.129
Shut up! You two can't just do
as you please!

00:08:24.212 --> 00:08:26.214
Seems to me we helped out in a pinch.

00:08:26.464 --> 00:08:28.216
My subordinates were killed!

00:08:28.383 --> 00:08:29.676
You should be used to that.

00:08:29.759 --> 00:08:30.635
You little...

00:08:35.265 --> 00:08:38.268
Not that it matters to me,
but what was that humanoid earlier?

00:08:38.601 --> 00:08:40.270
Neo Xianglong's new weapon?

00:08:40.353 --> 00:08:42.814
I wouldn't know!
I've never seen a machine like that.

00:08:43.106 --> 00:08:45.525
He defeated the BRAI
with just one machine.

00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:48.528
His power and speed were extraordinary.

00:08:48.862 --> 00:08:50.113
You call that "defeated"?

00:08:50.363 --> 00:08:52.866
He barely avoided destroying the city!

00:08:53.575 --> 00:08:55.493
What was... that force?

00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:57.746
<i>Excuse me!</i>

00:08:58.955 --> 00:08:59.831
It's...

00:09:00.498 --> 00:09:01.332
Is that...

00:09:02.917 --> 00:09:04.711
It's the pilot of the humanoid!

00:09:05.003 --> 00:09:07.047
Huh? That guy?

00:09:07.714 --> 00:09:10.091
Isn't there somewhere
we can get a bite to eat?

00:09:13.344 --> 00:09:16.181
Oh, wow! We meet again! Wow!

00:09:16.556 --> 00:09:18.725
Thank you so much for earlier.

00:09:19.142 --> 00:09:21.019
-Oh, wow!
-I'm glad you're safe.

00:09:21.186 --> 00:09:22.937
-Wow! Wow! Wow!
-I...

00:09:23.021 --> 00:09:25.065
I heard you looked after my sister.

00:09:31.279 --> 00:09:32.864
Hey! What exactly...

00:09:34.157 --> 00:09:35.575
-Leon!
-Hey!

00:09:36.242 --> 00:09:38.203
What's wrong? Were you injured?

00:09:38.703 --> 00:09:41.206
I-- I'm running low on energy...

00:09:41.664 --> 00:09:42.665
Energy?

00:09:48.838 --> 00:09:50.840
Oh, wow! Oh, wow! Oh, wow!

00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:54.010
It's a gift from the princess.

00:09:58.431 --> 00:09:59.766
-Let's eat!
-Let's eat!

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:03.478
Sheep meat!

00:10:07.565 --> 00:10:08.733
Here we go!

00:10:13.738 --> 00:10:15.657
Delicious!

00:10:15.824 --> 00:10:18.409
It's spicy, as usual. Good though.

00:10:18.493 --> 00:10:19.327
XIANGLONG HOTPOT

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.703
Take it easy there.

00:10:24.082 --> 00:10:25.583
It's not just delicious,

00:10:25.667 --> 00:10:27.961
there are
medicinal ingredients in here, too!

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:29.754
It boosts the metabolism

00:10:29.838 --> 00:10:32.590
-and even promotes digestion.
-So, fighting makes you hungry?

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:34.968
So good!

00:10:35.051 --> 00:10:36.052
You on a diet?

00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:39.097
I prefer girls with a body
like yours anyway.

00:10:41.057 --> 00:10:43.017
Are delicate guys with glasses your type?

00:10:43.476 --> 00:10:46.771
I felt something evil from the humanoid.

00:10:47.105 --> 00:10:48.022
However,

00:10:48.398 --> 00:10:49.482
this man...

00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:52.277
Is just an amateur, any way you slice it.

00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:55.572
Leon, is your hunger almost gone?

00:10:57.532 --> 00:11:01.452
Yeah, but I've never been
so hungry in my life.

00:11:01.828 --> 00:11:03.830
I wonder what's gotten into me.

00:11:04.455 --> 00:11:07.292
I bet you're really feeling
those hotpot spices.

00:11:08.877 --> 00:11:10.503
And you would be...?

00:11:10.837 --> 00:11:12.839
Cain Ibrahim Hassan.

00:11:13.506 --> 00:11:17.719
Bodyguard of the mayor
and exterminator of BRAIs.

00:11:18.052 --> 00:11:20.513
I was waiting for you! Now, our reward...

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:23.725
You will receive compensation
as stated in the contract.

00:11:24.309 --> 00:11:25.560
The damn contract...

00:11:26.436 --> 00:11:27.854
But before that,

00:11:28.062 --> 00:11:32.317
Doug Horvat and Queenie Yoh.
What do you say, want another job?

00:11:32.775 --> 00:11:35.528
Looks like we've hooked him.

00:11:36.279 --> 00:11:39.490
Sorry, I'll have to refuse.
Where are the entry passes?

00:11:39.699 --> 00:11:42.994
It's a long-term job.
It'd be a shame if you missed out.

00:11:43.494 --> 00:11:46.247
I strive to not stay in one place
for too long.

00:11:46.789 --> 00:11:49.083
Well, if you change your mind,
I'll be here.

00:11:49.959 --> 00:11:53.588
If we ever meet again,
let's relax and get to know each other.

00:11:56.966 --> 00:11:58.384
And Leon Lau.

00:11:59.844 --> 00:12:02.138
The mayor would like to see you.

00:12:04.265 --> 00:12:05.600
Good timing.

00:12:06.893 --> 00:12:09.062
I have something to ask as well.

00:12:20.156 --> 00:12:23.534
-So, I really am the one who defeated it.
-That's not all.

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:27.538
You almost destroyed the city's
absolute-defense system, too!

00:12:29.624 --> 00:12:30.750
This was me, too?

00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:35.213
Please don't tell us you've also forgotten
what happened seven years ago.

00:12:39.092 --> 00:12:41.260
Does that answer your questions?

00:12:42.053 --> 00:12:43.930
Yes, much appreciated.

00:12:44.097 --> 00:12:45.473
-Cecile--
-Princess.

00:12:45.598 --> 00:12:47.767
I told you to call me "Princess."

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:48.935
Have you forgotten?

00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:51.604
My apologies, Princess.

00:12:51.854 --> 00:12:52.855
It's fine.

00:12:53.064 --> 00:12:55.566
How is it being back in Neo Xianglong?

00:12:56.234 --> 00:12:58.528
The power supply seems stable.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:01.155
The city will never fall into darkness.

00:13:01.406 --> 00:13:03.533
It's humanity's light of hope.

00:13:04.075 --> 00:13:08.413
Neo Xianglong looks as delightful
as a dragon dancing through the clouds.

00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:12.709
It's proof of our determination
to never yield when faced with hardship.

00:13:13.209 --> 00:13:16.170
Pardon me, but have we met
somewhere before?

00:13:16.504 --> 00:13:18.506
I'm Jay Yoon, the Secretary of Ministry.

00:13:18.715 --> 00:13:21.050
Nice to meet you. I'm Leon Lau.

00:13:21.884 --> 00:13:24.137
I am suspending your exile.

00:13:25.013 --> 00:13:27.056
<i>You'll protect Neo Xianglong</i>
<i>from the BRAI,</i>

00:13:27.223 --> 00:13:30.059
<i>and complete the control</i>
<i>of the quantum reactor.</i>

00:13:30.643 --> 00:13:33.271
<i>Such were the purposes</i>
<i>of your research, no?</i>

00:13:33.354 --> 00:13:35.148
<i>So, you knew?</i>

00:13:35.648 --> 00:13:39.027
<i>For the past five years,</i>
<i>the princess has been</i>

00:13:39.444 --> 00:13:42.405
<i>monitoring your actions</i>
<i>to gauge your usefulness.</i>

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.116
I see. So, I'm a cat?

00:13:45.742 --> 00:13:46.576
A cat?

00:13:46.951 --> 00:13:49.328
Well, it's not as if you were in a box,

00:13:49.579 --> 00:13:51.539
and you're not cute like a cat.

00:13:51.998 --> 00:13:54.751
You're right. I'm sorry.

00:13:55.209 --> 00:13:59.130
Depending on the circumstances,
you may be asked to leave again.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.424
I will do everything I can
to prevent that.

00:14:04.927 --> 00:14:06.262
<i>You're here early.</i>

00:14:08.973 --> 00:14:10.224
This form...

00:14:10.975 --> 00:14:15.021
After the battle,
its power shut off and it took this shape.

00:14:15.521 --> 00:14:16.981
Because the ignition...

00:14:17.523 --> 00:14:19.317
Because I lost consciousness?

00:14:19.817 --> 00:14:23.029
This machine was made by Dr. Lon, right?

00:14:23.529 --> 00:14:24.489
Dr. Lon?

00:14:24.906 --> 00:14:26.866
The one working on the quantum reactor?

00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:27.950
Yes.

00:14:28.034 --> 00:14:32.121
It was originally made to test
the quantum reactor as an energy source.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.625
I tried integrating
the hyperdrive as well, but...

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.585
Hyperdrive?

00:14:38.169 --> 00:14:41.089
A multidimensional accumulation system
that I developed,

00:14:41.422 --> 00:14:44.634
using the quantum reactor research
as a springboard.

00:14:45.134 --> 00:14:46.552
Multidimensional?

00:14:46.928 --> 00:14:48.638
But why make it humanoid?

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:49.806
Good point.

00:14:49.889 --> 00:14:54.352
Anything that sticks out like that
on the battlefield is as good as scrap.

00:14:54.727 --> 00:14:55.645
Humans...

00:14:56.062 --> 00:14:58.523
When it used me as an intermediary,

00:14:58.689 --> 00:15:00.900
<i>the hyperdrive activated</i>
<i>for the first time.</i>

00:15:01.567 --> 00:15:04.237
<i>There may be a connection.</i>

00:15:06.906 --> 00:15:08.574
So, why did you create it?

00:15:09.158 --> 00:15:12.995
To fight against the abnormally
fast evolution of the BRAI.

00:15:13.538 --> 00:15:15.623
So, you noticed as well, huh?

00:15:18.334 --> 00:15:19.752
Bring out the specimen.

00:15:21.587 --> 00:15:23.923
It's an organ from the giant class.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:27.093
We have found similar ones in other BRAI.

00:15:27.385 --> 00:15:30.012
-I see.
-Whether it was implanted by man

00:15:30.388 --> 00:15:32.849
or a product of evolution

00:15:33.474 --> 00:15:34.559
is a mystery.

00:15:35.435 --> 00:15:40.022
So, the princess went to the field
to uncover this thing's true nature?

00:15:40.356 --> 00:15:41.983
The mayor herself, huh?

00:15:42.191 --> 00:15:43.484
Well, whatever.

00:15:44.152 --> 00:15:45.361
The past few months,

00:15:45.486 --> 00:15:49.740
the number of BRAI attacks
has increased unprecedentedly.

00:15:49.991 --> 00:15:52.243
They underwent some unusual evolution,

00:15:52.452 --> 00:15:55.455
and have all developed abilities
previously undocumented.

00:15:55.913 --> 00:15:56.747
Leon.

00:15:56.998 --> 00:16:00.877
We've detected similarities
between your machine and this organ.

00:16:01.294 --> 00:16:05.339
I knew the quantum behavior was
similar to that of the hyperdrive,

00:16:05.423 --> 00:16:06.799
but even the structure?

00:16:06.883 --> 00:16:08.551
So you say,

00:16:08.718 --> 00:16:11.179
but aren't you the one who developed this?

00:16:14.015 --> 00:16:15.016
I see.

00:16:15.141 --> 00:16:18.728
I didn't foresee this kind
of misunderstanding coming up.

00:16:19.228 --> 00:16:23.274
What are you two on about?
I came here to talk about work.

00:16:23.357 --> 00:16:25.651
Who are you trying to say this guy is?

00:16:27.028 --> 00:16:30.323
Leon Lau,
a researcher of the physics of evolution.

00:16:30.698 --> 00:16:35.661
Formerly Dr. Lon's right-hand man
in the Quantum Reactor Development Team.

00:16:35.828 --> 00:16:40.041
He's one of the men who destroyed
the world by running the reactor rampant.

00:16:46.339 --> 00:16:47.548
He's the one?

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:08.736
Leon!

00:17:09.111 --> 00:17:09.946
Shit!

00:17:17.912 --> 00:17:19.288
You're slow, sonny.

00:17:19.705 --> 00:17:21.707
I'm not "sonny!" It's "Captain!"

00:17:24.252 --> 00:17:25.586
Cain! Are you okay?

00:17:26.295 --> 00:17:27.588
It seems...

00:17:27.838 --> 00:17:31.217
the hotpot spices from yesterday
worked a little too well.

00:17:32.426 --> 00:17:34.470
Thank you.

00:17:39.058 --> 00:17:40.851
Now for the real problem.

00:17:41.686 --> 00:17:46.983
I want to make a special team here
to fight against unique BRAIs.

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:51.654
How's that sound? You in?

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:03.374
Hey Emilia, finally back, I see.

00:18:05.918 --> 00:18:07.336
Well, someone's pleased.

00:18:07.587 --> 00:18:10.423
I think we'll be in this town
for a while longer.

00:18:11.716 --> 00:18:13.175
I know, I know.

00:18:15.177 --> 00:18:17.054
I won't leave you alone.

00:18:22.977 --> 00:18:23.978
<i>Where are you,</i>

00:18:24.645 --> 00:18:25.646
<i>Hao Wang?</i>

00:18:42.163 --> 00:18:43.372
What's the deflation rate?

00:18:43.539 --> 00:18:45.708
Within the margin of error
five years straight.

00:18:46.459 --> 00:18:47.877
All according to predictions.

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:53.716
What are you doing?

00:18:56.719 --> 00:18:57.553
You...!

00:18:58.346 --> 00:18:59.180
Are you...?

00:19:00.973 --> 00:19:04.477
Yes. Both Dr. Lon's
and my data were recorded,

00:19:04.769 --> 00:19:07.938
so we are the only ones
with access to the reactor.

00:19:09.023 --> 00:19:10.733
I was never informed of this!

00:19:10.983 --> 00:19:13.527
We've succeeded in suppressing the output,

00:19:13.736 --> 00:19:15.863
but we still lack complete control.

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:19.200
I didn't want it to be touched
in my absence.

00:19:19.325 --> 00:19:20.409
I knew it!

00:19:20.493 --> 00:19:23.537
You cannot be trusted.
You're hiding something!

00:19:23.913 --> 00:19:25.748
-Huh?
-What happened seven years ago?

00:19:26.123 --> 00:19:28.334
The doctor died, but you survived.

00:19:28.501 --> 00:19:30.169
Was that really an accident?

00:19:36.342 --> 00:19:38.094
I can't speak to that yet.

00:19:38.177 --> 00:19:39.679
The fact is, I don't know

00:19:40.179 --> 00:19:41.681
what the truth is either.

00:19:42.139 --> 00:19:46.352
Yet another reason I feel I need
to complete the control of the reactor.

00:19:46.519 --> 00:19:50.147
Can you guarantee you won't lose control
of the reactor again?

00:19:50.272 --> 00:19:53.859
Where's the proof that you won't abuse
its tremendous power?!

00:19:55.361 --> 00:19:58.239
I really am Schrodinger's cat after all.

00:19:59.824 --> 00:20:01.909
Until the observer opens the box,

00:20:01.992 --> 00:20:05.037
he doesn't know if the cat inside
is dead or alive.

00:20:06.038 --> 00:20:07.957
<i>Are you sure about this?</i>

00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:09.208
I sense

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.378
something off about this Leon Lau.

00:20:13.129 --> 00:20:14.046
Pandora.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.047
What?

00:20:15.172 --> 00:20:16.507
The name of the team.

00:20:17.341 --> 00:20:20.553
Will it be fortune or calamity
which springs from the box?

00:20:22.471 --> 00:20:24.515
You must be prepared to lose something

00:20:25.182 --> 00:20:27.935
to be able to gain anything at all.

00:20:32.273 --> 00:20:34.984
I will no longer be a cat.

00:20:35.526 --> 00:20:37.319
Nor will I be a simple observer.

00:20:37.653 --> 00:20:38.487
Of what?

00:20:38.571 --> 00:20:40.865
I want to move of my own free will.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:43.743
I want to solve the puzzle of the BRAI,

00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:45.995
perfect the hyperdrive,

00:20:46.328 --> 00:20:47.663
and control the reactor.

00:20:48.247 --> 00:20:50.166
Do you think you are capable of that?

00:20:50.499 --> 00:20:52.209
I will give it my very best effort.

00:20:52.626 --> 00:20:54.253
Can you protect this city?

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:56.672
That's why I came back.

00:20:57.715 --> 00:20:58.716
You...

00:20:58.924 --> 00:21:01.427
Are you saying you can save this world?!

00:21:02.261 --> 00:21:03.095
No.

00:21:03.637 --> 00:21:05.055
I will destroy it.

00:21:40.382 --> 00:21:41.592
With this power...

00:21:43.385 --> 00:21:47.264
I will destroy this insane world
and build a new one.

00:21:47.848 --> 00:21:49.183
If I can't...

00:21:53.103 --> 00:21:55.356
<i>humanity will perish.</i>

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.494
So, Leon Lau has returned, huh?

00:23:33.329 --> 00:23:38.459
I will turn him, the princess,
and all of Neo Xianglong into hotpot.

00:23:41.337 --> 00:23:42.630
We're home...

00:23:43.797 --> 00:23:44.673
big brother.

00:23:46.759 --> 00:23:50.179
NEXT
2038 NEO XIANGLONG

00:23:50.262 --> 00:23:51.889
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
